@startuml GameOverRematch_UseCaseClassDiagram
title Use Case: Game Over / Rematch (incl. Forfeit, Award Win on Disconnect) - Participating Classes

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
hide empty members

enum GameState {
  PLACEMENT
  IN_PROGRESS
  FINISHED
}

enum LobbyStatus {
  WAITING
  IN_PROGRESS
  FINISHED
  ABANDONED
}

enum EndReason {
  FLEET_DESTROYED
  OPPONENT_FORFEIT
  OPPONENT_DISCONNECTED
}

enum RematchStatus {
  NONE
  REQUESTED
  ACCEPTED
  DECLINED
}

enum ShotResult {
  MISS
  HIT
  SUNK
}

class UIManager <<boundary>> {
  + showResult(r : GameResult) : void
}

class NetworkHandler <<boundary>> {
  + onDisconnect(p : HumanPlayer) : void
}

class Server <<controller>> {
  + forfeit(code : String) : void
  + requestRematch(code : String, accept : boolean) : RematchRequest
}

class Lobby <<controller>> {
  - status : LobbyStatus
  + reset() : void
  + abandon() : void
}

class Game <<controller>> {
  - state : GameState
  - winner : Player
  - endReason : EndReason
  - finishedAt : DateTime
  + checkWinCondition() : boolean
  + declareWinner(p : Player, r : EndReason) : void
  + forfeit(p : Player) : void
  + resultFor(p : Player) : GameResult
}

class GameResult <<entity>> {
  - didWin : boolean
  - shotsFired : int
  - accuracy : float
  - shipsSunk : int
  + summary() : String
}

class RematchRequest <<entity>> {
  - requestedBy : Player
  - status : RematchStatus
  - requestedAt : DateTime
  + accept() : void
  + decline() : void
  + isMutual() : boolean
}

abstract class Player <<entity>> {
  - id : UUID
  - name : String
  + hasLost() : boolean
  + requestRematch() : RematchRequest
}

class HumanPlayer <<entity>> {
  - connected : boolean
  - disconnectedAt : DateTime
  + hasExceededGracePeriod() : boolean
}

class AIOpponent <<entity>>

class Board <<entity>> {
  + allShipsSunk() : boolean
  + reset() : void
}

abstract class Ship <<entity>> {
  - hits : int
  + isSunk() : boolean
}

class Shot <<entity>> {
  - result : ShotResult
  + isHit() : boolean
}

' ---------- Relationships ----------
UIManager ..> GameResult : shows >
UIManager ..> Server : requestRematch >
NetworkHandler ..> Game : reports disconnect >
Server ..> Lobby : resets on mutual accept >
Server ..> Game : forfeits for caller >

Lobby "1" *-- "1" Game : runs >
Lobby --> LobbyStatus

Game "1" o-- "2" Player : players >
Game "1" *-- "0..*" Shot : history >
Game "1" --> "0..2" GameResult : produces >
Game "1" --> "0..1" RematchRequest : holds >
Game --> GameState
Game --> EndReason

RematchRequest --> RematchStatus
RematchRequest "*" --> "1" Player : requested by >

Player <|-- HumanPlayer
Player <|-- AIOpponent
Player "1" *-- "1" Board : owns >

Board "1" o-- "5" Ship : fleet >
Shot --> ShotResult

GameResult ..> Shot : derived from >

note bottom of Game
  Win detection runs once per shot and
  must be authoritative, so it lives on
  the server (brief, 3.2.1). If a
  HumanPlayer has no presence for 60 s,
  declareWinner(opponent,
  OPPONENT_DISCONNECTED) is called.
end note

note right of RematchRequest
  Multiplayer rematch needs both players
  to agree. Accepting calls Lobby.reset():
  same code, new Game in PLACEMENT.
  In single-player the AI always accepts.
end note

@enduml
